[SE00116] ⏱️ STEP REQUIRED [Line 1]: A range of 'Time' needs 'by'; a Time has no natural step.
  --> bad_time.splat:1:11
   |
 1 | loop t in tm"09:00:00"..tm"10:00:00":
   |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  Fix: Add a step, for example 'by 15m' (Time), 'by 1h' (Stamp).

[SE00106] 🤹 WRONG TOOL [Line 4]: '+' has no idea what to do with a 'Date' and a 'Stamp'.
  --> bad_time.splat:4:6
   |
 4 | z := d"2024-01-01" + t"2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"
   |      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  Fix: Two points in time cannot be added; subtract them to get a Dur.

[SE00106] 🤹 WRONG TOOL [Line 5]: '+' has no idea what to do with a 'Cal' and a 'Time'.
  --> bad_time.splat:5:6
   |
 5 | w := 1mo + tm"01:00:00"
   |      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  Fix: A Cal (months, years) only works with a Date or a Stamp; a Time of day has no calendar.

